      "findingMessages": {
        "p0004-001": "`YuNet::with_preprocess` is a public builder that replaces the detector's preprocessing policy (scale, mean). A repository-wide search finds no caller in production code, tests, or examples (`crates/segment/examples/yunet_qualify.rs` uses `YuNet::detect_rgb` and fixed preprocessing only), so the setter is unreachable from any route, CLI, or test and its validation branch is never exercised.",
        "p0004-002": "`pub const INPUT_SIZE` in `lightcraft_segment::yunet` has no reference anywhere in the repository (code, tests, examples, or docs), so it is an orphaned export that a reader may take as the configured input size while the real size is fixed by the private `INPUT_SIDE`.",
        "p0004-003": "`label_row` is a `pub fn` in `panels::right` with no caller in the workspace (searched all .rs files; the only match is its definition). It draws a label/value row that no panel renders, so it is dead code unless an external crate consumes `lightcraft_ui_egui::panels::right`."
      },
